msgstr "ArduPilot 固件安装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-Swan-K1.rst:16 08774d7edc10442abf3c5525daa5b22b
#: 6369e8c4e63c466a82c5082a9cd04e83 835fecac041b4581999fb4d366bc14bb
