"Connect to Mission Planner or QGC, and upload the Plane firmware for the "
"SWAN-K1 located `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"连接至 Mission Planner 或 QGC，并上传 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 的 "
"SWAN-K1 Plane 固件。"

